-- Expected-refusal probe for the first BANG consumer of the generic Lean lattice-store core.
-- Both components are pure Int/max computations, but ADR-0114 currently accepts only components
-- that are already syntactic values. Keeping this source rejected is more honest than replacing
-- generic join with one constant operation per lattice element.
import LatticeStore

handle
  store.joinPut(300)
with (LatticeStore_Store 100) as store {
  update joinPut(value) =>
    (if param < value then value else param,
     if param < value then value else param),
  observe(ignored) => param
}
